        \Delta p &\approx \frac{\hbar}{\Delta x} = \frac{6.626 \times 10^{-34}\ \text{Js}}{2\pi(1.0 \times 10^{-10}\ \text{m})} = 1.05 \times 10^{-24}\ \text{kg}\text{m}\text{s}^{-1}
